CREDITS — One Coin a Day

- Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1, @fontsource/press-start-2p): Press Start 2P — used for the pixel text.
- Palette: ENDESGA 32 by Endesga (free to use), plus three protected duplicate entries.
- All sprites, portraits and scenes are drawn in code at 320×180; no third-party images.
- Narration voice: Kokoro-82M ('am_liam') via kokoro-onnx — model weights and code Apache-2.0 (https://github.com/thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx, https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M). Phonemes: espeak-ng (GPL-3.0, used as a tool, not shipped).
